  "description": "Single storey front extensions;&nbsp; attached outbuilding at the rear to house boiler and plant system; external alterations",
  "development_type": "Other house holder developments",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;The proposed single storey front extensions, by\r\nreason of their forward projection, flat roof form and increased visual\r\nprominence on the corner site would disrupt the prevailing pattern of\r\ndevelopment, read as an incongruous and out of character design and be visually\r\nintrusive along the streetscene. As a result, the development would detract\r\nfrom character and appearance of the area and would be contrary to the National\r\nPlanning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D3 of The London plan (2021) and policy GR1 of the\r\nHarrow Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;font face=&quot;Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed single storey front extension by\r\nreason of its excessive depth, height and position along the shared boundary with No.96 Uppingham Avenue would result in adverse detrimental impact to the neighbouring amenity of the\r\nadjoining neighbouring property at No.96 Uppingham Avenue in terms of loss of outlook and increased sense of enclosure and would be contrary to the\r\nNational Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D3 of The London plan (2021) and\r\nGR1 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
